  "prefLabel": "Ins 4106.02 Applicability and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4106.02 Applicability and Scope. This part shall apply to disability income insurance, blanket coverage, group supplemental coverage, and any other type of health coverage that is identified as an excepted benefit under RSA 420-G:2, IX.\n\nSource. #9690, eff 4-9-10; ss by #9938, eff 6-10-11; ss by #12799, eff 6-10-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4100.html"
